Description: Device Uniqueness Backend - Surfaces, Routing and Attester
Network: ../zombienet-configs/local-dev.toml
Creds: config

# ============================================
# Prerequisites
# ============================================

# The backend connects to People Chain on startup and does not bind its HTTP
# port until that succeeds, so the parachain has to be producing blocks before
# any endpoint answers.
people-collator1: is up

alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 is registered within 400 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 block height is at least 5 within 500 seconds

# ============================================
# Identity Backend Tests
# ============================================

# Exercises the merged origin rather than the services directly: identity-api and
# username-indexer split /api/v1/usernames between them, so a routing regression
# is invisible when probing either port on its own.
#
# Covers readiness (chain + db), the advertised attester matching the account
# the allowance script granted to, JWKS, username search reaching the indexer,
# and unrun services reporting themselves instead of 404ing.
people-collator1: js-script ./scripts/dist/test-dub.js return is equal to 1 within 600 seconds
